A file named as a major version whose change is backward compatible: the
version is derived from the compatibility check, and the name must agree.
-- ship/history/0.0.thema --
schema: {
	a: string
}
-- ship/1.0.thema --
schema: {
	a:  string
	b?: int
}
-- out/error --
1.0.thema: this version is backward compatible with 0.0, so it is minor version 0.1: rename the file, or make the change breaking:
    1.0.thema:1:1
